{"resource":"lines/maint-of-buildings-contrcted-services","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":19,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":null,"cited_as":"budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/budget-hearing-fy22-superintendent-39-s-recommended-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/budget-hearing-fy22-superintendent-39-s-recommended-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":null,"cited_as":"budget-hearing-fy22-superintendent-39-s-recommended-budget.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/final-fy25-budget-4-3-24.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/final-fy25-budget-4-3-24.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":null,"cited_as":"final-fy25-budget-4-3-24.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy21-proposed-budget-april-29-2020.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy21-proposed-budget-april-29-2020.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":null,"cited_as":"fy21-propos